# Exercise: URL-Safe Base64
#
# Standard Base64 uses +, /, and = which are problematic in URLs.
# URL-safe Base64 uses - and _ instead, with no padding.
#
# encoding.base64url-encode ( String -- String )
# encoding.base64url-decode ( String -- String Bool )
#
# Use cases:
# - JWT tokens
# - URL query parameters
# - Filenames
#
# Your task: Implement URL-safe encoding/decoding
# When done, delete the marker line below.

